T* (### Environment Strategy) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (- dev for engineering and experimentation) Tj
T* (- tst for integration and release validation) Tj
T* (- prd for controlled production use) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### Workspace Strategy) Tj
