T* (- `ws-npw-bi-{env}`) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (In trial, the physical topology may be simplified, but the target design remains separated by ) Tj
T* (ownership and lifecycle.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### Administration Model) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (- Fabric admins own tenant settings and tenant-wide controls) Tj
T* (- capacity admins own scale, monitoring, and workload behavior) Tj
T* (- platform engineers own automation, workspace lifecycle, and guardrails) Tj
T* (- domain or data product owners own business-aligned assets) Tj
